`--mask` replaces the `index.md` default outright. The tree holds both an `index.md` and a
milestone file; the explicit mask selects only the milestone, which the default mask cannot match,
and drops the `index.md` the default mask would have taken.

-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plan/index.md --
---
sessions: []
---

Body.
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plan/M01-alpha.md --
---
sessions: []
---

Body.
-- cmd --
booping session-stats vault --mask 'M*.md' --dry-run
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
{
  "artifacts": [
    {
      "path": "plan/M01-alpha.md",
      "written": false,
      "sessions": [],
      "totals": {
        "metrics_active_minutes": 0,
        "metrics_models": [],
        "metrics_tokens_input": 0,
        "metrics_tokens_output": 0,
        "metrics_tokens_cache_creation": 0,
        "metrics_tokens_cache_read": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}
